###############################################
# BULK HOTEL IMPORT (multipart/form-data)
###############################################

### 1. Upload Ukrainian Hotels CSV
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/HotelImports
Authorization: {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ukrainian_hotels.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../../ukrainian_hotels.csv
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 2. Upload Polish Hotels PDF
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/HotelImports
Authorization: {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="poland_hotels.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../../poland_hotels.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 3. Upload Polish Hotels JSON
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/HotelImports
Authorization: {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
